{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Corbaci, where the soup is hot and the stories are chilling.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Corbaci: A Cozy Cinematic Horror</i> blends atmospheric storytelling, light management gameplay, and a taste of the uncanny.\u00a0Detect the anomalies in your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cozy yet unnerving horror experience, you run a small soup shop during increasingly surreal nights. Each customer brings not only a craving for soup, but also a creeping sense of dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731260/extras/be5dff145d2af4d8e350997cf8c29343.poster.avif?t=1772803865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731260/extras/be5dff145d2af4d8e350997cf8c29343.webm?t=1772803865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731260/extras/be5dff145d2af4d8e350997cf8c29343.mp4?t=1772803865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features physics-based interactions, allowing objects and environments to react dynamically to the player\u2019s actions, adding a layer of immersion and realism to the horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731260/extras/958ace714bad00e4a3bfe9fefd29fc2d.poster.avif?t=1772803865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731260/extras/958ace714bad00e4a3bfe9fefd29fc2d.webm?t=1772803865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731260/extras/958ace714bad00e4a3bfe9fefd29fc2d.mp4?t=1772803865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main tool: the Super Soup 2000, a mysterious machine capable of preparing any soup\u2014if you input the right ingredients. These soups can grant extra effects\u2014taste them yourself or serve them to your customers. Unlock all the secret recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the nights pass, cinematic horror tales begin to unfold around you. Shifting shadows. Familiar faces that shouldn\u2019t be here. Voices whispering behind the stove. Your shop is no longer just a business\u2014it's the stage for something deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy? Maybe. Safe? Not quite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3731260?t=1772803865","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731260/e0cb0012c32c40572ca853504fc0732109a06544/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772803865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731260/5faa03e8dff813ed99eeb97e403e76cb0a05513f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772803865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731260/5faa03e8dff813ed99eeb97e403e76cb0a05513f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772803865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Corbaci: A Cozy Cinematic Horror contains scenes of psychological tension, unsettling imagery, and occasional blood. Viewer discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Corbaci, where the soup is hot and the stories are chilling.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Corbaci: A Cozy Cinematic Horror</i> blends atmospheric storytelling, light management gameplay, and a taste of the uncanny.\u00a0Detect the anomalies in your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cozy yet unnerving horror experience, you run a small soup shop during increasingly surreal nights. Each customer brings not only a craving for soup, but also a creeping sense of dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731260/extras/be5dff145d2af4d8e350997cf8c29343.poster.avif?t=1772803865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731260/extras/be5dff145d2af4d8e350997cf8c29343.webm?t=1772803865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731260/extras/be5dff145d2af4d8e350997cf8c29343.mp4?t=1772803865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features physics-based interactions, allowing objects and environments to react dynamically to the player\u2019s actions, adding a layer of immersion and realism to the horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731260/extras/958ace714bad00e4a3bfe9fefd29fc2d.poster.avif?t=1772803865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731260/extras/958ace714bad00e4a3bfe9fefd29fc2d.webm?t=1772803865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731260/extras/958ace714bad00e4a3bfe9fefd29fc2d.mp4?t=1772803865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main tool: the Super Soup 2000, a mysterious machine capable of preparing any soup\u2014if you input the right ingredients. These soups can grant extra effects\u2014taste them yourself or serve them to your customers. Unlock all the secret recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the nights pass, cinematic horror tales begin to unfold around you. Shifting shadows. Familiar faces that shouldn\u2019t be here. Voices whispering behind the stove. Your shop is no longer just a business\u2014it's the stage for something deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy? Maybe. Safe? Not quite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["TPA Gameworks "],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731260/d66bd01a1048d5a10bafc7fbbd43d6c817d7ff5f/header.jpg?t=1772803865","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any Patato Linux distribution</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macos sequoia 15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Silicon M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3731260/418202824/753ba03dc4c0181ee2d6d8be84755c86892892e8/1750396595/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747255850","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3731260/418202824/753ba03dc4c0181ee2d